A NOTE ON FORKING

If this repository is public on GitHub, GitHub's Terms of Service grant every
GitHub user a licence to reproduce it by forking, through GitHub's own
functionality, regardless of what this file says. That cannot be switched off
while the repository is public.

What this licence governs is what may be done with such a copy. Reading it,
auditing it, and preparing a contribution are permitted. Publishing it,
building on it, running a modified version, or taking parts of it into other
software are not.
